#. Description of the plugin
#: you-emulator.php
msgid "Retro game library for WordPress powered by EmulatorJS: NES, SNES, Sega Genesis, GBA, PlayStation, PSP and N64 right in the browser, with server-side save states, hotkeys and gamepad combos."
